<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Deutsche starts Commnet.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Deutsche starts Commnet.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it initiated coverage of Commnet Cellular Inc with a buy rating and a year-end price target of $35.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/4 at 28.</p>
